      "insight": "Leviathan readers click EVM content not to understand Ethereum itself but to track the race to clone, optimize, or replace it — attention concentrates on which new EVM-compatible L1 is winning TVL and developer incentives, and whether ZK-proofs or RISC-V will make the original runtime obsolete.",
